// Unions, and narrowing. That is the list.
//
//   union layout          a tag and a payload, one pass
//   niche packing         `*T | none` is one pointer, and it falls out of layout
//   is / narrowing        flow analysis over bindings that cannot change
//   or                    narrow to the first member, else the right side
//   match                 narrow one arm at a time, and count the members
//   type                  unit, struct, union, alias. one declaration form
//
// Optionals cost no compiler code. Errors cost no compiler code. Exhaustiveness
// is counting a set, not solving nested patterns. There is no prelude type the
// compiler has to know by name.
